  <item>
    <title>S2 EP23｜TXO兄弟情拚到底、答应粉丝一定会重返赛场 ft. Hanzo（下集）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668f7cf137236c546e60a0a8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668f7cf137236c546e60a0a8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Jul 2024 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 开头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">00:00:09</a> 从SMG离开成立TXO的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="111">00:01:51</a> 大成和Hanzo第一次碰面就是谈判鸿门宴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">00:06:01</a> 想成为电竞五月天开始学乐器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">00:08:25</a> 自发性不加薪就因为想让公司好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="577">00:09:37</a> 为了拚冠军把手机锁在保险柜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="715">00:11:55</a> 转战激斗峡谷的那一年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">00:16:53</a> 为什么后续没有回到GCS职业联赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1143">00:19:03</a> MOP来询问愿不愿意借将</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1387">00:23:07</a> 做直播顺风顺水，为什么还愿意重返职业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1519">00:25:19</a> MOP让Hanzo久违感受到竞技的魅力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1771">00:29:31</a> 好像可以试着当看看教练</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">00:32:12</a> 当教练比起原本顾虑的还要多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2151">00:35:51</a> 有线下观赛观众的比赛可以激发肾上腺素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2246">00:37:26</a> 认出选手欢迎大方上前打招呼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2379">00:39:39</a> 职业生涯里面最打击的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2557">00:42:37</a> 电竞对Hanzo来说是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>请为Hanzo和ANK接下来的赛季应援吧 &nbsp;@TXOHanzo</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是GG私密答 今晚和你聊聊那些电竞故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持群：Crystal、江大成</span></p><span></span><p><span>各大Podcast平台搜寻「GG私密答」</span></p><span></span><p><span>追踪我们或是订阅你习惯的收听平台</span></p><span></span><p><span>工商合作欢迎来信📨 gg.sumida.gaming@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
