    <guid isPermaLink="false">66866c8fae8e21859a7fbe28</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jul 2024 09:34:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 开头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6">00:00:06</a> 中路土地公Hanzo来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">00:03:33</a> 老师指路走向传说对决</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">00:06:41</a> 要去台北又要签合约是不是被诈骗了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="472">00:07:52</a> 老板是周杰伦还是林俊杰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="788">00:13:08</a> 最后一刻才组成SMG梦幻五人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="893">00:14:53</a> 队内第二小的Hanzo成为队长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="996">00:16:36</a> 刚开始发展的传说没有标准答案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1113">00:18:33</a> 团练连输到被别队嘲讽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">00:20:16</a> 我们都是为了赢而来拚的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">00:23:42</a> 现在的竞技心态不太一样了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1592">00:26:32</a> 用兄弟情打电竞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1686">00:28:06</a> 夺冠之后就有人私讯来要签名跟借钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1776">00:29:36</a> 跟着老板和至隆学应对进退</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">00:31:30</a> 为了粉丝让二追三打回来</span></p><span></span><p><span>下集将在下周四同一时间发出</span></p><span></span><p><span>请为Hanzo和ANK接下来的赛季应援吧 @TXOHanzo</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是GG私密答 今晚和你聊聊那些电竞故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持群：Crystal、江大成</span></p><span></span><p><span>各大Podcast平台搜寻「GG私密答」</span></p><span></span><p><span>追踪我们或是订阅你习惯的收听平台</span></p><span></span><p><span>工商合作欢迎来信📨 </span><a href="mailto:gg.sumida.gaming@gmail.com"><span>gg.sumida.gaming@gmail.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
