  <item>
    <title>S2 EP21｜英雄联盟成为生命的解药 ft. 冠纬｜GG私密答</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667d440dc37399840c8366fc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667d440dc37399840c8366fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Jun 2024 10:50:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 前言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">00:02:12</a> 从小被朔月称赞电玩天赋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">00:04:52</a> 卡丁车账号被盗开始接触LOL</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="376">00:06:16</a> 荒废学业被确诊中度过动症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">00:12:20</a> 心理咨商师认可游戏是帮助入定的关键</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="824">00:13:44</a> 隔墙用杯子偷听家中网络密码</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">00:17:14</a> 玩到台服没有竞争对手、夸口拿世冠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1138">00:18:58</a> RNG试训豪华阵容打爆对手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">00:22:28</a> 波比教练诚挚邀请妈妈点头加入RNG青训</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">00:24:34</a> 打职业是每一个高端的梦想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1562">00:26:02</a> Uzi偷吃辣条始末</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1806">00:30:06</a> 在厕所跟Karsa要合照</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">00:31:34</a> 四叶讲了大家难以接受的大实话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2138">00:35:38</a> 没上过场，走人还多领两个月薪水</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2414">00:40:14</a> 兄弟十八相送把自己也送走了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2668">00:44:28</a> 大成欠冠纬的一顿饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2816">00:46:56</a> 冠纬认可的实力型实况主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2936">00:48:56</a> 远赴DRX挑战韩服菁英</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3146">00:52:26</a> 爆哥安排的女友式观光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3428">00:57:08</a> 亚洲杯队伍的关注重点：中野连动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3842">01:04:02</a> 恩人兄弟联动让实况开始崛起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4066">01:07:46</a> 招募罗杰成为中路队友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4208">01:10:08</a> 小说不中二不穿越不转生不看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4296">01:11:36</a> 如果不当实况主了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4792">01:19:52</a> 电竞对冠纬来说是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>对冠纬有兴趣的听众们欢迎来追踪他 @guanweiboy</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是GG私密答 今晚和你聊聊那些电竞故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持群：Crystal、江大成</span></p><span></span><p><span>各大Podcast平台搜寻「GG私密答」</span></p><span></span><p><span>追踪我们或是订阅你习惯的收听平台</span></p><span></span><p><span>工商合作欢迎来信📨 gg.sumida.gaming@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
