  <item>
    <title>S2 EP20｜公关出大事了！舆论不是用来分输赢的一场仗｜GG私密答</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6673fe7eb6a84127292265de</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6673fe7eb6a84127292265de</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Jun 2024 10:03:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 前言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:00:42</a> 记得的歌手梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">00:03:13</a> 记得开始意识到是公众人物的瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">00:04:51</a> 大成从小有公众人物的自觉被说油</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">00:06:05</a> 公关危机是什么、每个人都有几个面具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">00:09:47</a> 小毕姐也不敢直面酸民</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="837">00:13:57</a> 选手生病也是战队的错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">00:15:55</a> 走A怪事件的处理标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">00:21:55</a> 观众信息都是被筛选过的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1461">00:24:21</a> 积极响应舆论的人是否有利可图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1599">00:26:39</a> 不要让团队从爆料才知道真相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1904">00:31:44</a> 动手前先处理好情绪并保持稳定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2208">00:36:48</a> 让子弹飞一会、由时间帮你处理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2397">00:39:57</a> 以实力表态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2511">00:41:51</a> 自我肯定派和外在肯定派</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2761">00:46:01</a> 战队很愿意为选手捍卫权益</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2967">00:49:27</a> 适当诉诸法律是必要的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3474">00:57:54</a> 怎么看用选手社群发布声明稿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3664">01:01:04</a> 永远不要觉得自己能掌握舆论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3794">01:03:14</a> 舆论不是用来分输赢的一场仗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4011">01:06:51</a> 生命中重要的人远比网络舆论来得珍贵</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是GG私密答 今晚和你聊聊那些电竞故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持群：Crystal、记得、江大成</span></p><span></span><p><span>各大Podcast平台搜寻「GG私密答」</span></p><span></span><p><span>追踪我们或是订阅你习惯的收听平台</span></p><span></span><p><span>工商合作欢迎来信📨 gg.sumida.gaming@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
