    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Jun 2024 10:54:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 前言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">00:01:47</a> 带坏Jacky的坏朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">00:06:03</a> 被 RR 洲际系列赛大震撼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">00:09:45</a> 吃吃喝喝无缝接轨第一份工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="836">00:13:56</a> 画饼给选手的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">00:17:49</a> 想到上海看更大舞台的年轻人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">00:23:30</a> 成功脱下选手偶包的超 E 社牛领队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1799">00:29:59</a> 待一个月的新人直接挑战主管加薪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">00:40:30</a> 江湖再见真的有机会再见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2623">00:43:43</a> 直接百万人民币放桌上抢 LoL M 选手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2846">00:47:26</a> 来自哪个领域的手游选手打得最好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2895">00:48:15</a> 就算夺冠也不见得认为是自己的成绩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3237">00:53:57</a> 职位越高就要背负更多的期待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3477">00:57:57</a> 选手造星之前还是得先讲求成绩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3704">01:01:44</a> 电竞环境要好也需要联盟的支持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3877">01:04:37</a> 被LoL和王者荣耀夹在中间的LoLM</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4112">01:08:32</a> 喜欢电竞不一定要搞深度电竞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">01:12:00</a> 电竞对Jacky来说是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>请为接下来的RW战队与Jacky应援吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是GG私密答 今晚和你聊聊那些电竞故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持群：Crystal、江大成、记得</span>