    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Jun 2024 11:35:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 开头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">00:01:05</a> VSPO是什么样的组织</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179">00:02:59</a> 谢总负责的业务内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="279">00:04:39</a> 学霸的丰富学校生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">00:06:21</a> 学生时期就幻想电竞成为未来职业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="479">00:07:59</a> 从令人称羡的职业四大会计事务所到电竞创业家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">00:09:27</a> 与WE周老板Zax的缘份起点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="716">00:11:56</a> 0家庭革命的转职电竞创业家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="863">00:14:23</a> 谢总是WE股东吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="937">00:15:37</a> 从格斗游戏玩家身上看到对电竞纯粹的热爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">00:19:50</a> 谢总自评游戏实力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">00:21:44</a> VSPO在电竞世界杯中担任的角色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1476">00:24:36</a> 电竞世界杯比赛游戏项目怎么决定、奖金规划标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1592">00:26:32</a> 长驻战队的条件标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1653">00:27:33</a> 战队奖金池的初衷在于扶持队伍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">00:30:30</a> 为了五万美金抢MVP？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1926">00:32:06</a> 石油王子们为什么要办电竞世界杯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2114">00:35:14</a> 把全世界的赛事都拉到沙特阿拉伯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2454">00:40:54</a> 电竞可以聚集年轻人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">00:43:00</a> 会不会有英雄联盟主题乐园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2726">00:45:26</a> 看腻了英雄联盟？还是要来点新东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3047">00:50:47</a> 电竞的游资潮过去了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3217">00:53:37</a> 选手能接受薪资天花板限制吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3493">00:58:13</a> 长时间下来一定是良币逐劣币</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3615">01:00:15</a> 电竞越来越专业化、需要长期投资</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3738">01:02:18</a>选手口袋赚满满很容易变投资肥羊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3991">01:06:31</a> VSPO用爱发电、用副业来圆虚拟偶像梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4172">01:09:32</a> 未来VR让你体验虚拟屠龙的竞技</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4398">01:13:18</a> 记得事件让谢总更加考虑内心的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4550">01:15:50</a> 这个圈子到底有没有买水军</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4733">01:18:53</a> 如果找I人当讲师，要记得PUSH他</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4816">01:20:16</a> 观众对比赛不变的疲劳感，不如吃瓜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5091">01:24:51</a> 如果自己的小孩想要走上电竞这条路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5253">01:27:33</a> 电竞对谢总来说是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>请期待 VSPO 英雄体育接下来的发展吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是GG私密答 今晚和你聊聊那些电竞故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持群：Crystal、江大成、记得</span></p><span></span><p><span>各大Podcast平台搜寻「GG私密答」</span></p><span></span><p><span>追踪我们或是订阅你习惯的收听平台</span></p><span></span><p><span>工商合作欢迎来信📨 gg.sumida.gaming@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
