    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 前言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:00:18</a> 上节目可以让人更了解自己也不错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">00:02:46</a> 现在正在跟你对线的是小学生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">00:06:37</a> 小时候开台比较像是OB游戏视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">00:08:32</a> 本来想继承爸爸的警察梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="624">00:10:24</a> 靠自己研究打到韩服700分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1097">00:18:17</a> 不知道职业选手跟绝活哥之间的差距</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">00:21:40</a> 业余队比赛输了就甚么都没有了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1419">00:23:39</a> 这角色如果强到顶不住就要去练</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1698">00:28:18</a> 跟比赛最大差异是Rank的人更愿意去冒险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1928">00:32:08</a> 这么慢开始职业生涯需要更努力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2165">00:36:05</a> 骂我可以，不可以骂我家人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2509">00:41:49</a> 有观众的线下比赛可以更加血脉贲张</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2693">00:44:53</a> SOLO选边跟上路单挑不太一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3012">00:50:12</a> 想要挑战 PSG Azhi 其他角色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3146">00:52:26</a> 送头前一刻理解怎么样做的更好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3435">00:57:15</a> 黑子说话 白子说话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3738">01:02:18</a> 评价别人强不强很容易偏题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3868">01:04:28</a> 喜欢看 Bin 保持压制力又不送的操作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4037">01:07:17</a> PCS三帅：Karsa、Tide、Betty</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4226">01:10:26</a> 用 Windows XP 和 60 Hz 的屏幕上韩服700分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4558">01:15:58</a> 想要听看看 BeryL的 call</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4771">01:19:31</a> 大家都在玩的角色反而不想练</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4997">01:23:17</a> 电竞对 1Jiang 来说是甚么</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是GG私密答 今晚和你聊聊那些电竞故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持群：Crystal、江大成</span></p><span></span><p><span>工商合作欢迎来信📨 gg.sumida.gaming@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
