    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 前言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="21">00:00:21</a> 想过是跟SHG一战PCS春季赛冠军吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">00:02:26</a> 自己单机有点没意思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">00:05:20</a> 在网咖CARRY大人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="439">00:07:19</a> 大家都吹自己是跑最后一棒的人 谁是狼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">00:09:05</a> 为了方便要到位置，结果账号被锁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="743">00:12:23</a> 第一次上菁英整个人虚脱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="954">00:15:54</a> 土龙曾经是Betty面前一座高山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1141">00:19:01</a> 战马寄与厚望的海滩裤小朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1408">00:23:28</a> 只要能最快当先发选手，换路也OK</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1592">00:26:32</a> 当闪电狼的AD太牺牲了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1897">00:31:37</a> 教练会比选手好拿到冠军</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">00:34:45</a> 被Uzi推荐加入RNG</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2299">00:38:19</a> 学会当个勇于往前操作的AD</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2701">00:45:01</a> 要宏宏请客很难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2835">00:47:15</a> LOL越来越不看年纪了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3042">00:50:42</a> 请英雄联盟设计师爱护高龄化选手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3198">00:53:18</a> 以前不在意的叨念，现在反噬了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3406">00:56:46</a> 枫棠依旧十七岁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3581">00:59:41</a> 海